## ▶️ How to Run the Streamlit Application

1. Clone or download this repository.
2. Install the required libraries:

```bash
pip install streamlit pandas plotly openpyxl
```

3. Run the application:

```bash
python -m streamlit run app.py
```

## 📝 Conclusion
This project demonstrates how ride-booking data can be analysed to identify operational trends, revenue patterns, and customer behaviour. It combines data analysis, visualisation, and interactive reporting to support data-driven business decisions.

